{"id":"44dd658f048c8786","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-ultrafilter-existence.md","title":"Ultrafilter Extension Theorem","display":"thm-ultrafilter-existence — Ultrafilter Extension Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-ultrafilter-existence","aliases":["57-thm-ultrafilter-existence"],"display":"thm-ultrafilter-existence — Ultrafilter Extension Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","[[57-df-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-ultrafilter-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-ultrafilter-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ultrafilter-existence — Ultrafilter Extension Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e\" href=\"?note=d524fe3a9fa3eb7e\" title=\"57-df-filter\">57-df-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I \\neq \\varnothing\">\\(I \\neq \\varnothing\\)</span> (非空指标集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F \\in \\mathrm{Filter}(I)\">\\(\\mathcal F \\in \\mathrm{Filter}(I)\\)</span> (真滤子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e\" href=\"?note=d524fe3a9fa3eb7e\" title=\"57-df-filter\">57-df-filter</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ultra\">\\(Ultra\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence\">\\(thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ultra\">\\(Ultra\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence\">\\(thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Filter\">\\(Filter\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ultra\">\\(Ultra\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence\">\\(thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Filter\">\\(Filter\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ultra\">\\(Ultra\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence\">\\(thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence} \\vdash (I \\neq \\varnothing \\land \\mathcal F \\in \\mathrm{Filter}(I) \\land \\mathcal F \\neq \\mathcal P(I)) \\to \\exists \\mathcal U\\,(\\mathcal F \\subseteq \\mathcal U \\land \\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence} \\vdash (I \\neq \\varnothing \\land \\mathcal F \\in \\mathrm{Filter}(I) \\land \\mathcal F \\neq \\mathcal P(I)) \\to \\exists \\mathcal U\\,(\\mathcal F \\subseteq \\mathcal U \\land \\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the standard ultrafilter extension principle, commonly obtained from Zorn's lemma.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I \\neq \\varnothing$ (非空指标集, see [[57-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"d524fe3a9fa3eb7e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F \\in \\mathrm{Filter}(I)$ (真滤子, see [[57-df-filter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I \\neq \\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F \\in \\mathrm{Filter}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"Ultra","display":false},{"tex":"thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence","display":false},{"tex":"Ultra","display":false},{"tex":"thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence","display":false},{"tex":"Filter","display":false},{"tex":"Ultra","display":false},{"tex":"thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence","display":false},{"tex":"Filter","display":false},{"tex":"Ultra","display":false},{"tex":"thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ultrafilter\\text{-}existence} \\vdash (I \\neq \\varnothing \\land \\mathcal F \\in \\mathrm{Filter}(I) \\land \\mathcal F \\neq \\mathcal P(I)) \\to \\exists \\mathcal U\\,(\\mathcal F \\subseteq \\mathcal U \\land \\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I))","display":true}],"bytes":1156,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b0